LINE 1: ...T * FROM JSON_TABLE(jsonb '1', '$' COLUMNS (a int true on em...
                                                             ^
DETAIL:  Only ERROR, NULL, or DEFAULT expression is allowed in ON EMPTY for scalar columns.
